  "instructions": {
    "en": "Think about ordinary tasks you actually took part in during the past four weeks, whether in paid work, study, volunteering or a shared project. At relevant opportunities, how often did you do what each statement describes? Use Never only when a relevant opportunity existed and you did not do it. With no opportunity, too little information or a choice not to answer, use the unscored option. The questions do not ask you to disclose an incident or prove your character. Changes in workload, resources, authority and safety matter; accepting impossible demands or responsibility outside your control is not required.",
    "zh": "回想过去四周实际参与的普通任务，可以是有偿工作、学习、志愿活动或共同项目。在相关机会中，你多常按陈述做？只有遇到相关机会而没有这样做时才选“从未”。没有机会、信息不足或不愿回答时选不计分。题目不要求披露具体事件或证明品格。任务量、资源、权限和安全会影响选择；不要求接受不可能的任务或承担控制范围外的责任。"
  },
